Overlay patch 0001: bump torch's pinned spdlog to v1.16.0 (modern-clang fix).
Torch pins spdlog @ 7e635fca (pre-1.15), whose bundled fmt breaks on current
AppleClang: consteval FMT_STRING in fmt_helper.h is rejected ("call to
consteval function ... is not a constant expression"), killing TorchExternal
(USE_STANDALONE=ON fetches unconditionally) and any machine where
find_package(spdlog) misses. v1.16.0 is exactly what this LUS fork's
mac.cmake already falls back to, so both spdlog consumers in the tree agree
on one version. Both GIT_TAG occurrences (standalone + library branch) move.
Upstreamable to HarbourMasters/Torch.

--- a/torch/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/torch/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -242,7 +242,7 @@
 	FetchContent_Declare(
 		spdlog
 		GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/gabime/spdlog.git
-		GIT_TAG 7e635fca68d014934b4af8a1cf874f63989352b7
+		GIT_TAG v1.16.0 # match libultraship/cmake/dependencies/mac.cmake
 	)
 
 	FetchContent_MakeAvailable(spdlog)
@@ -253,7 +253,7 @@
         FetchContent_Declare(
             spdlog
             GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/gabime/spdlog.git
-            GIT_TAG 7e635fca68d014934b4af8a1cf874f63989352b7
+            GIT_TAG v1.16.0 # match libultraship/cmake/dependencies/mac.cmake
         )
 
         FetchContent_MakeAvailable(spdlog)
